  <prompt>Close the unified-access-control-r2 project: run the mandatory /test-diet gate, close out design-register hygiene items H-8a and H-8b, write lessons-learned, flip the README to Complete, and reconcile TASK-INDEX/current-task. Follow root CLAUDE.md §7's project-close protocol exactly.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Project closure procedures. Follow root CLAUDE.md §7 strictly.</role>
  <goal>test-diet report generated and cited; H-8a/H-8b closed (or explicitly re-dispositioned with rationale); notes/lessons-learned.md written; README status Complete with summary; TASK-INDEX all-green; current-task.md reset to "none"; wrap-up PR cites the test-diet report per the binding gate.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Root CLAUDE.md §7 project-close test diet gate (BINDING): task-execute Step 11 invokes /test-diet BEFORE marking the project complete; skipping is a HARD WARNING and the wrap-up PR MUST cite the report or document the skip rationale. Register items: H-8a = stale comments naming the deleted ExternalCallerAuthorizationFilter/ExternalCallerContext (Api/ExternalAccess/ExternalProjectDataEndpoints.cs:13,24,339 — plus the further grep hits: ExternalDataService.cs:16, ExternalCallerContext.cs:7, ExternalUserContextEndpoint.cs:14,18, ExternalAccessEndpoints.cs:52); H-8b = RevokeExternalAccessEndpoint.cs:182 returns vestigial WebRoleRemoved: false (Power Pages relic, Dtos/RevokeAccessResponse.cs) and retains a best-effort SPE-permission-removal path — H-8b was flagged "related to A-13 (FR-16), fix together", so FIRST verify what the Phase 0 FR-16 task already did and close only the remainder.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/ExternalProjectDataEndpoints.cs (H-8a comments)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/ExternalAccess/ExternalDataService.cs + ExternalCallerContext.cs (H-8a comments)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/ExternalUserContextEndpoint.cs (H-8a comments)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/RevokeExternalAccessEndpoint.cs + Dtos/RevokeAccessResponse.cs (H-8b)</file>
      <file role="new">projects/unified-access-control-r2/notes/lessons-learned.md</file>
      <file role="modify">projects/unified-access-control-r2/README.md</file>
      <file role="modify">projects/unified-access-control-r2/tasks/TASK-INDEX.md + current-task.md</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="083" status="pending">Last phase task; all phases complete before closure.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md-§7">/test-diet runs BEFORE completion; it is read-only (emits git rm/git mv for the reviewer — do NOT auto-execute deletions); the wrap-up PR cites projects/unified-access-control-r2/notes/test-diet-report.md. Scope: closure sequence.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">H-8a is comment-only: no behavioural edits ride along under the cleanup banner. Scope: every H-8a file.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">H-8b: removing WebRoleRemoved from RevokeAccessResponse is an API-contract change — grep ALL clients (AccessGrantModal, SPA, Teams) for consumers of the field first; if any consumer reads it, coordinate the removal or keep the field with a deprecation comment and record the decision. Scope: the DTO edit.</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md-§10">The H-8x edits touch BFF files: verify build + report publish size in the PR even for cleanup. Scope: PR.</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md-§7">Completion order: task poml statuses -> TASK-INDEX -> current-task reset -> README -> report. Scope: closure sequence.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>project closure</topic>
    <files>
      <file>projects/unified-access-control-r2/notes/design-register.md</file>
