  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">notes/test-diet-report.md exists and is cited in the wrap-up PR description; no test deletion was auto-executed.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Grep for ExternalCallerAuthorizationFilter across src/ returns zero comment references (H-8a closed).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">H-8b dispositioned: either WebRoleRemoved removed with consumer-grep evidence, or kept-deprecated with the documented reason; the design register updated either way.</criterion>
