    <criterion testable="true">README status Complete incl. success-criteria mapping; TASK-INDEX fully reconciled; current-task.md reads "none".</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: build green after the H-8x edits; no behavioural test changes required by them (proving cleanup-only).</criterion>
